<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n108573" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποκλίνω</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῑ</span>], <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bend under</i> or <i>in subjection to,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γόνυ τινί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nonn.
					<u>D.</u>
					15.124
				</span></i>
			: but usu. in 
				Pass.
			, <i>recline</i> or <i>lie down under,</i> c. dat., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σχοίνῳ ὑπεκλίνθη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					5.463
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				9.71
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Antiphil.
			</span></i>), etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Βάκχῳ νύμφη
				ὑποκλινθεῖσα,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποδμηθεῖσα</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Orph.
				<u>A.</u>
				195
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μαζὸς ὑπεκλίνθη</span>”
				<i>has grown flaccid,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					AP
					5.272
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Agath.
			</span></i>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποκεκλιμένων τῶν
			σκελῶν</span> with the legs <i>bent,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Aët.
				16.111
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>give way to,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅταν τὸ ἐπιθυμητικὸν -κλίνηται τῷ
					θυμικῷ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Herm.
					<u>in Phdr.</u>
					p.157
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				A.
			</span></i>: so intr. in 
				Act.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰ . . ὑποκλίνοιτε φάλαγγι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Orph.
					<u>A.</u>
					848
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>turn aside,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Phlp.
				<u>in Mete.</u>
				85.39
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
